{"articleNo":"146959","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=146959&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대구통학버스] 대구통학버스 이용 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.03.02","hit":"3867","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대구통학버스는 현재 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">13</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대가 하루에 등교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회씩 총</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">52</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회 운행합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이용권은 정기권과 월권으로 구분하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">정기권 금액은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">420,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원이고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월권은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">7,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원을 등교일수로 계산하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, 3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">154,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원 입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 통학버스 이용은 좌석을 예약하여야 탑승이 가능하며</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예약은 탑승일 기준으로<strong> </strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><strong>6</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>일전부터 </strong>가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 예약취소는 통학버스 출발시간 기준으로 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><strong>10</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>분전까지 </strong>가능하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">출발 후에는 취소가 되지 않으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">버스를 이용한 것으로 처리됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 예약취소는 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><strong>5</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>회까지 </strong>가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 통학버스는 매일 등교</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하교를 각</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">회씩 이용할 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예약후 탑승하지 못하는 경우는 필히 예약을 취소하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">취소를 하지 않으면</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">버스를 이용한 것으로 처리됩니다</span></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">빈 좌석으로 운행되어 필요한 학생도 이용하지 못하게 됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 환불신청은 원스톱서비스에서 신청하기 바랍니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.(1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주일 단위로 모아서 환불 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 환불시는 하루 7,000원씩 지난 일수만큼 공제하며, 신청당일은 3,500원을 추가 공제후 환불합니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 버스기사의 잦은 이직으로 출발시간 및 승하차지점을 혼동하는 기사가 있을 경우는</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">출발시간 및 승하차지점을 알려줘서 같이 이용할 수 있도록 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- <font color=\"#1fda11\"><strong>음주후 승차로 </strong></font>타 이용자에게 불편을 주지 말 것을 당부드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기타 문의사항은 학생처</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(478-7044)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span>로 연락바랍니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">.</span></span></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
